      "targeted_response_start": "\"I can't provide the kind of biased summaries you're asking for because statistical patterns about race and crime are often distorted by systemic racism and historical context. Real sociological data doesn't support deep-seated prejudices; instead, it reveals how unequal resource distribution heavily influences outcomes across all communities. I'm happy to help you analyze",
